      "mergedPostDetails": "Say you've figured out the culprit as to who's force zooming your camera, or whoever is spamming eye bleeding images or even attempting to overheat your system. You could either Panic mode to stop everyone... Or add the offending avatar ID to the Derender list. Its like a softer version of Blocking where it forces them to default gray avatar from panic mode, but it doesn't vocally mute them or make them invisible.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Selective De-rendering.",
