      "mergedPostDetails": "Being able to turn off a specific user's avatar to make them a ghost instead of invisible so that you can still socialize with them.\nIve been in many rooms before where theres a number of people and one or two in particular have avatars that are a bit too much for me to handle but I dont want to outright block them, if I could just turn off thier avatar to be that ghosted thing it would help.",
